pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, 2020</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월까지 졸업이 가능하며 수습근무에 차질이 없어야함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; L