</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업예정자는 졸업 학점의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">3/4 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이상을 취득하여야 하고 이수한 모든 과목의 평점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">총평점평균</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 기준으로 한 석차가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;각 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span><span styl